### Why deploy in Report-only first?

Report-only allows administrators to evaluate policy impact using sign-in logs before enforcing the policy in production, reducing the risk of unintended user lockouts.

### Why use a pilot group?

Enterprise Conditional Access policies should be deployed gradually using pilot populations before organization-wide rollout.

### How does this support Zero Trust?

Every authentication attempt is evaluated against organizational security policies before access is granted.
